caller: Caller\n(person or parent agent)

supervisor: Agent Supervisor\n(confirm, check, continue)

worker: Worker agent\n(Codex, Claude, or local)

caller <-> supervisor: Task + criteria / completion or blocker
supervisor <-> worker: Work or correction / result + evidence
